<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland to redeem 11.5pct Development Loan early.</title>
<headline>Ireland to redeem 11.5pct Development Loan early.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) on Tuesday announced the early redemption of the 11.5 percent Development Loan 1997-1999.</p>
<p>The stock will be redeemed on November 15, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
